3
00:00:02,453 --> 00:00:04,583
Dozens of witnesses stood nearby.

4
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,102
But almost everyone told

5
00:00:06,102 --> 00:00:07,077
police they had not

6
00:00:07,077 --> 00:00:08,007
seen the shooter.

7
00:00:08,226 --> 00:00:09,667
Skidmore, Missouri.

8
00:00:09,794 --> 00:00:11,088
Nineteen eighty-one.

9
00:00:11,283 --> 00:00:12,729
Ken McElroy had frightened

10
00:00:12,729 --> 00:00:13,864
the town for years.

11
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,909
He threatened neighbors, intimidated

12
00:00:15,909 --> 00:00:18,184
