13
00:00:18,313 --> 00:00:19,122
Then he shot an

14
00:00:19,122 --> 00:00:20,747
elderly grocery store owner.

15
00:00:20,849 --> 00:00:22,070
The man survived.

16
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,070
This time, a

17
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,768
jury convicted McElroy.

18
00:00:24,953 --> 00:00:25,884
But he was released

19
00:00:25,884 --> 00:00:27,424
