23
00:00:30,366 --> 00:00:32,175
And threatened the grocer again.

24
00:00:32,395 --> 00:00:34,028
On July tenth, residents

25
00:00:34,028 --> 00:00:35,068
gathered to discuss how

26
00:00:35,068 --> 00:00:36,374
