27
00:00:36,518 --> 00:00:38,065
Meanwhile, McElroy and his

28
00:00:38,065 --> 00:00:39,470
wife arrived at the bar.

29
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:41,201
The crowd headed there too.

30
00:00:41,403 --> 00:00:42,343
Ken walked out and

31
00:00:42,343 --> 00:00:43,674
