32
00:00:43,809 --> 00:00:45,164
People stood around him.

33
00:00:45,322 --> 00:00:46,715
Then shots rang out.

34
00:00:46,847 --> 00:00:48,277
McElroy was dead.

35
00:00:48,498 --> 00:00:49,491
His wife said she

36
