46
00:01:04,686 --> 00:01:05,859
After his death, the

47
00:01:05,859 --> 00:01:07,379
law was powerless again.

48
00:01:07,565 --> 00:01:08,547
Only now, the

49
00:01:08,547 --> 00:01:09,684
town was silent.

50
00:01:09,805 --> 00:01:11,083
Was this justice?

51
00:01:11,251 --> 00:01:11,901
Or a murder

52
00:01:11,901 --> 00:01:13,294
